 "_doc": "Symbol sheet: the second part of the page. 'qet' = EN 60617 number (part-section-symbol) of the QElectroTech element in content/elements/qet/, or a path under content/elements/ (qet/<composite>, fixed/<our correction>, rebt/<our own drawing in the style of the Guía>); 'ref' = the official figure an own drawing follows, shown instead of the number; 'iec' = the number shown when it differs from 'qet' (QElectroTech swaps 03-02-01 junction and 03-02-02 terminal); 'star' replaces the '*' of a general symbol (machine, instrument); 'notext' drops the element's captions; 'code' = reference letter (IEC 60750). See README.md.",
